1.5%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M114%20388%20H286%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%234b4c52%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20stroke-dasharray%3D%224%204%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M58%20322%20L98%20328%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%234b4c52%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20stroke-dasharray%3D%224%204%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M342%20322%20L302%20328%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%234b4c52%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20stroke-dasharray%3D%224%204%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E', '[{"type":"p","text":"Every few years someone declares the denim jacket finished, and every few years it is back on the rack, a little more faded than before. The version people want now is the boxy chore cut from the nineties: wide through the shoulder, short in the body, with pockets deep enough to be useful."},{"type":"h2","text":"What a good one feels like"},{"type":"p","text":"Fabric first. Old denim was woven tighter and heavier, so it softens without going thin. Run a thumb along the elbows and the cuffs. If the cloth feels papery there, it has had its life."},{"type":"p","text":"Then the hardware. Original buttons that sit flat, a placket that closes without pulling, and a lining of fading that follows the way the person actually moved. That kind of wear cannot be faked, and it is why preloved denim photographs better than new."},{"type":"quote","text":"The best denim jackets have an opinion about how they should be worn."},{"type":"p","text":"Size up if you want the early-nineties shape. A medium chore jacket sits comfortably over a knit, and a large starts to read as a coat."}]'::jsonb, '2026-09-14'::date),
  ('2f28cb5b-8b56-5bde-8463-875053a5c220'::uuid, 'how-to-wash-what-you-thrift', 'How to wash what you thrift', 'Care', 'Sekar Ayu', 'Wool, denim and old cotton each need a different hand. A short guide to cleaning preloved clothes without undoing their age.', 'data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20800%20600%22%20width%3D%22800%22%20height%3D%22600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22800%22%20height%3D%22600%22%20fill%3D%22%23E8D8CF%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M30%20100%20H770%22%20stroke%3D%22%232D1F1A%22%20stroke-width%3D%223%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M270%20100%20V160%22%20stroke%3D%22%232D1F1A%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(80%2065)%20scale(0.95)%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cpattern%20id%3D%22f18%22%20width%3D%228%22%20height%3D%228%22%20patternUnits%3D%22userSpaceOnUse%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%222%22%20height%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%232D1F1A%22%20opacity%3D%22.16%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fpattern%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M140%20112%20L178%20104%20L200%20168%20L222%20104%20L260%20112%20L332%20182%20L342%20334%20L302%20340%20L294%20232%20L292%20408%20L108%20408%20L106%20232%20L98%20340%20L58%20334%20L68%20182%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22%23D9C7AC%22%20stroke%3D%22%237a6b5c%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M140%20112%20L178%20104%20L200%20168%20L222%20104%20L260%20112%20L332%20182%20L342%20334%20L302%20340%20L294%20232%20L292%20408%20L108%20408%20L106%20232%20L98%20340%20L58%20334%20L68%20182%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22url(%23f18)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M178%20104%20L200%20168%20L222%20104%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%237a6b5c%22%20stroke-width%3D%226%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20opacity%3D%22.55%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M200%20168%20V408%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%237a6b5c%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20c