ity%3D%22.55%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M110%20392%20H290%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23514a37%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M58%20324%20L98%20330%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23514a37%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M342%20324%20L302%20330%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23514a37%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E', '[{"type":"p","text":"A preloved piece has already survived years of washing. The goal is to keep it going, not to make it look new. A few habits do most of the work."},{"type":"h2","text":"Wool and knits"},{"type":"p","text":"Wash by hand in cool water with a small amount of gentle detergent, and press the water out rather than wringing. Dry flat on a towel, away from direct sun. Hanging a wet knit stretches the shoulders for good."},{"type":"h2","text":"Denim"},{"type":"p","text":"Wash it less than you think you should. When it does need it, turn it inside out, use cold water and let it dry in the shade. Heat is what shrinks the legs and cooks the colour."},{"type":"h2","text":"Old cotton and rayon"},{"type":"p","text":"Test a hidden seam for colour first. Old dyes can run, and rayon weakens when wet, so handle it gently and never twist it. If a smell lingers, an hour in the open air often does more than another wash."}]'::jsonb, '2026-08-30'::date),
  ('3af78f60-3ea7-5e60-8e85-c6e3ca822327'::uuid, 'a-closet-in-bandung', 'A closet in Bandung', 'Seller', 'Raka Pratama', 'Dara Wibowo has sold secondhand clothes for six years, mostly from a spare room. She talks about sourcing, flaws and what makes a listing honest.', 'data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20800%20600%22%20width%3D%22800%22%20height%3D%22600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22800%22%20height%3D%22600%22%20fill%3D%22%23E8D8CF%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M30%20100%20H770%22%20stroke%3D%22%232D1F1A%22%20stroke-width%3D%223%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M190%20100%20V160%22%20stroke%3D%22%232D1F1A%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(18%2074)%20scale(0.86)%22%3E%3Cdefs%3E%3Cpattern%20id%3D%22f20%22%20width%3D%2222%22%20height%3D%2222%22%20patternUnits%3D%22userSpaceOnUse%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2211%22%20cy%3D%2211%22%20r%3D%223.2%22%20fill%3D%22%23A4493D%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fpattern%3E%3C%2Fdefs%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M168%2092%20L184%2092%20L200%20130%20L216%2092%20L232%2092%20L246%20150%20L240%20232%20L314%20448%20L86%20448%20L160%20232%20L154%20150%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22%23EFE6D8%22%20stroke%3D%22%2384796f%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M168%2092%20L184%2092%20L200%20130%20L216%2092%20L232%2092%20L246%20150%20L240%20232%20L314%20448%20L86%20448%20L160%20232%20L154%20150%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22url(%23f20)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M158%20226%20H242%20V244%20H158%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22%23b5aa9f%22%20stroke%3D%22%2384796f%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M178%20248%20L152%20442%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%2384796f%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%20stroke-dasharray%3D%224%204%22%20opacity%3D%22.8%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M222%20248%20L248%20442%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%2384796f%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%20stroke-li